      "message": "Hey - this is right. We only want well-defined structures. For instance, if there is a 3rd party standard defining the byte array, then that\u0027s okay.\n\nIf this is vendor-specific, we should add a ParcelableHolder either here or directly in CodecCapabilities (if it is in CodecCapabilities next to capabilities, then you could add a vendor extension onto any other codec type. right now, the extensions are next to the types, they can also be in addition to the other types)",
